WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.060
That one's just a rough draft.

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:08.690
And I'm having a hard time coming up with an idea for the one-shot.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:12.950
Yes, I'll come up with something by next week.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:13.700
Okay,

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.910
thank you.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:33.570
It doesn't matter when

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:33.570
itsudemo donna toki mo

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:39.000
I always think of your smile

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:39.000
omoidasu no wa kimi no egao de

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:44.470
The single word that I couldn't say

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:44.470
mada sono tada hitokoto

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:49.670
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:49.670
kimi ni mo tsutae dainda zutto

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:53.150
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:53.150
ima wa fureoi inotteta

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.890
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.890
kumo wo tsuuka mienai

00:00:55.730 --> 00:01:00.640
In front of you, I swear that

00:00:55.730 --> 00:01:00.640
mae ni chikatta toshitemo

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:03.500
I will always be your side

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:03.500
koko ni iru yo

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:10.380
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:10.380
bokura no mezasu mirai wa mada mada tooku

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.940
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.940
hateshi naitteto

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:19.610
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:19.610
namida no sonowake ga aru kagiri

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:24.470
I will not stop moving towards it

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:24.470
massugu aruite yukou

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:34.400
As usual, we'll be together today

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:30.500
bokutachi wa nani mo kawarazu ni

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:34.400
kyou mo tonari ni iru

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:39.850
In the same world

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:39.850
onaji kono sekai ni ite

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:55.160
The Fourth Longsword

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:55.160
Chihaya
pretending to be Chihaya

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:05.430
Sensei is amazing!

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:08.390
The big guy is too!

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:13.400
Yoichi-san,

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.900
could you teach them the way of the sword too?

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:20.530
Is he strong too?

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:21.700
Yeah.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:22.910
He's a lot stronger than me.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.700
But...

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.410
I've never used my swordplay for show.

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:32.460
We can have a duel, and they can learn from watching.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.750
And truthfully,

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:38.220
it's just that I want to have a duel with you.

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:40.180
Just kidding.

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.600
I have wondered... how skilled you were.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:49.230
You're strong.

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.730
You aren't the Sensei here just in name.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:53.770
Very well,

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:58.400
I'll get a little serious!

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.330
Yoichi-san!

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.330
You're the worst!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.080
Thank you very much.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.630
Oww...

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.000
Be careful on your way home.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.720
Ibuki-dono...

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:24.050
Perhaps we have only four students because of your violent tendencies?

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:25.390
He's got a point.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.390
What was that?!

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:32.310
I just thought we would easily have more students

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:34.770
considering your skills.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.070
Flattering me won't get you anywhere.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.740
I am not speaking out of flattery!

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.660
Ayame, where are you going?

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:44.740
Bath.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:46.030
I'm all sweaty now.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:46.830
Hold on.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.620
We still have to clean up.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.830
Samurai, that's your cue.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:53.370
Okay...

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.650
You seem to be acting strange, Ayame-nee.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:23.910
Chihaya!

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.200
What're you doing?

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:30.580
I can't come up with any ideas, so I'm thinking of taking a bath for a change of pace.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.120
Did something happen with Yoichi-tsan?

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.880
How could that be, stupid?!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:36.880
Why-

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.380
Why would he come up?

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:44.260
Well, you've been nice to Yoichi-tsan recently,

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.970
and you're also showing up at the dojo.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:47.970
Shut up!

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.890
That doesn't mean anything!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.480
This might work!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.230
What?!

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.860
I'm gonna get some data on Yoichi-tsan.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.030
An interesting manga demands that

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:11.080
you collect data with your own body!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.710
This isn't awkward or anything.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:21.920
I only came to give this back.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.550
You came all the way just to deliver this?

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:27.430
I love you.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:28.680
I love you too.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.430
Then I'll beat the crap out of that stupid samurai, and...

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:33.850
I love you!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.690
I love you too!

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:38.100
All right, it's perfect.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:41.860
What?

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.070
What's with these shoes?

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.110
Damn dirty!

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:49.490
I'm about to enter the Ikaruga house, and I've made the mistake of my life!

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.990
And aren't these clothes too casual?

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:55.500
I may meet her family.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.580
I love you.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.620
Rejected.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.500
Damn...

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.510
I need to get changed!

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:13.930
Why is Ibuki-dono so violent?

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:18.440
She's so sweet when she's smiling.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.730
Yoichi-tsan.

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:22.980
Chihaya-dono.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.150
Yo.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.610
I can't wear this one anymore.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.740
Let's go, Yoichi-tsan.

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.870
Come on.

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:41.630
You drew all this, Chihaya-dono?

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:43.420
Yeah.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:49.880
Something wrong?

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.180
No...

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.720
What an interesting story.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:57.680
This is my first manga, but it's still very easy to follow.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.060
Impressive.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.480
A mere fifteen-year-old girl

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.770
is able to create such a world?

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.530
Is it boring?

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:09.070
No!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.700
I'm so awed that I'm at a loss for words!

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.820
I'm looking forward to the next part!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.330
Really?!

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:20.870
After that, there's gonna be a battle between the heroine who's lost her memory,

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:24.460
and another girl who is going to stop the main character.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.090
Sorry about that.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:29.130
I got carried away.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:32.800
I don't get the chance to hear guys' opinions very often...

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.640
So I feel better hearing you say that.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:39.810
What is it?

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:45.110
It's my first time seeing you so lively.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.320
Really?

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:47.820
Yes.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:51.820
It's getting me pumped up, too!

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.820
Oh, I almost forgot my real objective.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.120
Yoichi-tsan.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:00.620
Are you seeing someone right now?

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.710
What are you asking all of a sudden?

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.000
Well?

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.540
Are you?

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.290
Well...

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:10.210
I've always lived alone with my father in the mountains.

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.590
Then is there anyone you like?

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:16.220
Like one of us?

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.810
What are you...

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:22.560
Yoichi-tsan, you're making a cute face.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.310
If you get so close, your chest...

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:27.440
That's intentional, you know?

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:28.650
Very intentional.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.990
Yoichi-tsan, can't you hear it?

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.650
The beating of my heart?

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.910
Won't you make me your girlfriend?

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:40.620
Please, Yoichi-tsan?

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.380
Don't worry.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.590
We're all alone

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.840
to do whatever we want.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.890
I truly appreciate your feelings,

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:08.480
but I have come from the mountains for training.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.270
And,

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:13.150
you cannot strip for a man so readily.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:17.360
You are already very attractive even without that.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:23.870
It truly was fun for me to hear you talk about your story like that.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.000
So,

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.170
well...

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.590
I'm just kidding.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:36.380
I just wanted to see what kinda man you are,

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:40.850
and you're an honest one, right, Yoichi-tsan?

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:44.230
Chihaya-dono, I can't believe you'd-

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.980
Chihaya, are you all right?!

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.560
Did he do anything weird-

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:50.310
It's not what you think!

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:51.520
Chihaya-dono was-

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.780
Yoichi-tsan forcefully came onto me.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:55.780
You're terrible!

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:59.370
Chihaya, you can't let a guy into your room.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:01.030
Especially that beast!

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.280
Beast?

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:07.160
So you say, but I think you're just jealous.

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:09.790
Your relationship already went that far?

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.210
What?!

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:14.090
Why would I with this pervert?!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.470
Not this guy!

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:18.340
It's all a misunderstanding!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.050
You're lying!

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.090
You're definitely lying!

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.810
See? You <i>are</i> close.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.980
This is going to be fun.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.730
I can't believe this.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:35.150
For me to be taken as Yoichi-san's lover!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.700
But...

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:41.620
It's been a while since I saw her that happy.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.370
So I'll let it go this time.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:48.870
Chihaya works and attends school, you know?

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:53.460
She doesn't get much sleep and she sometimes needs to skip school,

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:56.050
so she can't play with her friends that much.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.300
Even if it's a job she likes,

00:10:57.610 --> 00:10:59.930
I think it has its ups and downs.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:03.930
But it looks like she was able to relieve some stress today.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.140
So thanks.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.430
Ibuki-dono.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.350
The protagonist is an honest knight.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:13.440
The heroine is the daughter of the leader of the knights,

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:16.820
who has as strong a will as the protagonist, but is always in conflict.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:18.690
But...

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.200
Chihaya.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.910
Other girls are also...

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.700
What did you do to Samurai?

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.950
Ayame-nee,

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:32.170
Yoichi-tsan is a good man.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:38.550
You shouldn't put a brake on your own feelings.

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.340
Ayame-oneechan?

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:48.810
You all right, Wassan?

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:52.060
Torigaya, how do I look?

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:52.730
That's an out.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:53.650
Really?!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:06.030
I forgot.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:09.290
The bathroom is inside the house.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.420
Chihaya-dono?

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:25.720
I'm home.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:28.100
I only asked you to grab the notebook!

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:30.680
Why did you grab my chest?!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:31.640
That was a coincidence!

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:33.730
How can that be a coincidence?!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.730
An accident.

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:34.730
Kagome-dono!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.230
Kagome?

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.570
Ow...

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.240
Are you all right?

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.870
Are you hurt?

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:55.750
I wanted to show it to everyone because I did such a good job in art class.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:03.050
I'm sorry, to the both of you.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.430
Please forgive me.

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:09.600
Ibuki-dono.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:13.230
Here, it's Chihaya's notebook.

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:16.400
She should be in review class right now.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.480
But she forgot it here.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.110
Can you go give it to her?

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:23.320
I need to fix Kagome's art project.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.900
Okay?

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.110
I sincerely accept.

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.740
I'm truly sorry, Ibuki-dono and Kagome-dono.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:36.080
I will not fail to hand this notebook to Chihaya-dono.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:40.170
That is the least I could do for the Ikaruga family.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:42.380
Chihaya-dono

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.010
must be in great trouble.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:45.880
I must deliver this at once.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:46.760
Excuse me!

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:47.720
Is Chihaya-dono-

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:56.190
The Kamakura government was subjugated, and Emperor Go-Daigo was...

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:05.190
Ikaruga, I don't mind you being enthusiastic,

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:07.150
but isn't this the manuscript for a manga?

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.570
Huh?

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:09.820
Where's my notebook?

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:10.820
Odd.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.990
I'm sorry, Teacher.

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:15.700
I mistook the manuscript for the notebook by accident.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.830
How do you do that?

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.580
You came here to review, so start taking notes!

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.590
Your work must be tough, but school is a place to learn.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.970
Someone catch him!

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.090
He's a pervert!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:33.060
It's a misunderstanding.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.100
Yoichi-tsan.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.730
You came to deliver this?

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.980
And that's why you got in this mess?

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.730
You're a prodigy at this, Yoichi-tsan.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.520
It doesn't feel like you're praising me.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:47.740
If you hadn't explained it to them, I would've been a goner.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.490
Even so,

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:55.910
you were studying late last night, but it would've all been for naught if you forgot your notebook.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.750
I wasn't studying last night.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:00.250
But the lights were on...

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.050
I was coming up with an idea for a one-shot.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:06.760
What?

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:12.760
I also have a series running, but I got a nice idea, so I ended up staying up late.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.720
Chihaya-dono, you must really love manga.

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:19.060
Yeah.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.390
I love it.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:25.770
I can't really do things seriously, but manga's an exception.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:29.110
What're you getting red for?

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.360
Remembering what you saw in the locker room?

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:32.700
Not at all.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:34.660
Don't take it seriously.

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:37.700
Thanks a lot, Yoichi-tsan.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:43.210
She teases people and is sometimes difficult to read.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:47.670
But she is pure and truly passionate about manga,

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:52.720
and just like her smile, her determination is very refreshing and honest.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:16:00.390
It's been nothing but trouble since Yoichi-san got here.

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:05.060
But you know, I'm not saying he's violent.

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:09.280
He's just a little rough, lewd, and rash.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:14.910
But he's really cool when he's swinging his sword.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.410
Ibuki-oneechan?

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:18.450
Oh!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.950
I'm almost done, okay?

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:22.960
Chihaya-dono walks the way of manga,

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.630
and I the way of swords.

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:30.460
Though the roads are different, I do wish to follow the example of her determination.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.800
Don't you think Ikaruga's way over her head?

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:39.560
She thinks she doesn't need to study 'cause she's a manga artist.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.930
That's what I was thinking.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:44.190
Manuscripts are more important than studying?

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:46.730
Drawing manga is no more than messin' around anyway.

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.980
Maybe I'll be a manga artist, too.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.780
It's not like I have any particular dream or anything.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:53.740
Yeah, making money the easy way's never a bad idea.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.660
Man, that felt good.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:17:00.160
I wonder how Ikaruga's feeling right now.

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.170
Chihaya-dono!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.300
Those bastards.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.350
I'm fine.

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:25.270
I still have time until the deadline.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:28.110
And school really isn't the place to draw manga.

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:31.110
It's my fault for doing something wrong.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.940
But-

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:37.110
Those footsteps... it's that demon Onigawara!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.990
You're in deep trouble if he finds you.

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:42.080
You better go quickly, Yoichi-tsan.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.160
Chihaya-dono!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.960
No one's here.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:52.300
Yoichi-tsan, you're too nosy.

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.340
I'm a manga artist.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:56.430
So redrawing is nothing to me...

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.720
You know... I...

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:06.770
never saw work as messing around.

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:08.810
I've always been serious.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.230
Why would they say that?

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:16.030
Why do they have to trample on my feelings?

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.170
Man...

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.800
School, studying, parents, and teachers...

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.220
The world sucks.

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:42.510
I don't see any fun in being so diligent.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.310
What's wrong with fooling around in life?

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.180
It's not like we can't survive that way.

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:48.730
Seriously.

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:51.560
It just pisses me off to see people who take things seriously.

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.030
It's that pervert from before.

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:59.910
As you have never lived a serious life,

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.370
you will never understand Chihaya-dono's pain!

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:04.910
What are you?

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.160
Ikaruga's boyfriend?

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:10.250
That hurts!

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.040
What the hell was that for?

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.500
That hurts, huh?

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:15.590
Don't make me laugh.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:16.460
How could that hurt?

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:20.970
You tore apart Chihaya-dono's heart.

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.350
Compared to that, this can't be called pain!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.310
Your life is your own.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:29.770
How you live is no business of mine.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:31.480
However,

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:36.230
sneering at those who live their lives seriously is not something I can forgive!

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.820
What's with him?

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.740
I don't get him.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.160
Why...

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:47.160
How can he get so serious for someone else?

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:55.040
How brutal.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.300
Ikaruga...

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:00.170
Damn it.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:06.430
Why are you so serious in this lame world?

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:10.140
Both you and... that samurai.

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:11.440
Samurai?

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:14.060
I don't get it.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:18.530
There's no need to rush.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.280
You'll find it one day.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:26.160
Something you treasure so much that you can live seriously.

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:30.080
Wassan, I wanna go home.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.290
Hold on, Torigaya, this is my last try.

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:33.830
Behold!

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.040
Way out.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:36.790
Really?

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:39.210
You're taking this the wrong way.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:43.720
In the end, it's not how it used to look.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.760
Only by a little, tiny bit.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:47.550
I'm terribly sorry.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:49.760
I like this better.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.730
Because Ibuki-oneechan fixed it.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:54.640
Kagome.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.150
It's done.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:58.650
What is that?

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.780
It's the protagonist for my next one-shot.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.950
That looks a little like Yoichi-san.

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:07.780
I modeled it after the superhero that beat up the guys at school.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:08.370
What?

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:10.040
That wasn't me!

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:13.290
I didn't see you cry or anything!

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:17.920
I'm gonna tell this story through manga and deliver it to a lot of people,

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:20.590
to show my appreciation to the superhero.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:26.090
I want to say both thanks and sorry through my manga.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:28.970
Yoichi-san, your hand...

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:36.060
Oh, it's blistered up from holding the sword for so long.

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:37.560
Me too.

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:39.060
Look, I got mine from writing.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:42.030
We match.

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:44.110
It's the proof of what we love.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.610
Now, I gotta fax these to the editor.

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:53.080
Yoichi-san!

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:55.540
You're dead if you lay a hand on her!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:58.120
What are you blushing for? Stupid, stupid!

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.580
But I...

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:04.300
I didn't do anything!

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:27.820
I regret not realizing

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:27.820
taisetsuna hito datte wakarazu ni

00:22:28.770 --> 00:22:35.390
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:28.770 --> 00:22:35.390
sugoshiteta imamade ga kuyashiiyo

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:42.950
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:42.950
jibun kara iwanakucha dame nanda

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:52.410
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:52.410
itsumademo itsumademo koko ni ite kienaide

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:56.640
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:56.640
yume unda onaji kimochi daitara

00:22:56.440 --> 00:23:00.400
Make me hesitate a little

00:22:56.440 --> 00:23:00.400
sukoshi mayoi kanji tetahazu

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:07.390
When I open my heart and free myself from sadness

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:07.470
kokoro hirake kanashimi toki hanatsu shunkan wa

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:11.260
I will seize tomorrow with both of my hands

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:11.260
ashita wo tsukamaeru ryoute

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:15.110
I hope you will light up the dawn in my heart

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:15.110
tomoshitai to negau yoake

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:17.460
You're not alone

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:17.460
hitori ja nai

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:21.790
Because I love you

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:21.790
masaka LOVE YOU

00:23:22.230 --> 00:23:26.400
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:22.230 --> 00:23:26.400
kawaruno ga kowai to kimi mo

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:29.960
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:29.960
kitto soba ni hohoemu kara

00:23:29.820 --> 00:23:37.420
Let's change kindness into strength

00:23:29.820 --> 00:23:37.420
yasashisa de tsuyoku narouyo

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:42.650
Next Episode!

00:23:42.650 --> 00:24:07.670
Fifth Longsword

00:23:42.650 --> 00:24:02.890
Let's go on a Date!

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:47.280
To whom it may concern,

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:49.570
This world is full of things I don't know...

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:52.240
...and full of things I want to know.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:54.870
I want to know how fast you walk.

00:23:54.870 --> 00:23:56.330
I want to know the warmth of your hands.

00:23:57.220 --> 00:24:00.580
I want to know the moment when we suddenly pause after starting to say the same thing.

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:04.540
What sort of lies will your smiling and angry faces tell?

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:05.790
My heart is full of wonder.

00:24:06.230 --> 00:24:09.420
I'll probably also be sleep deprived tomorrow.

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:10.670
Don't miss the next episode!
